{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:46 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:46 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:46 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"JW觀眾席同衛蘭對唱  王至尊私影老婆冧爆\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/2c251bcfa38fe605b360f2b2bdc31408/2026-11/page_160.jpg\"/><p>衛蘭《OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會》香港站紅館尾場，當晚擔任表演嘉賓之一的JW（王灝兒）和衛蘭合體大唱《男人信什麼》。</p><h2>康堤露面心情靚</h2><p>站在360纜車上的衛蘭，同坐在VIP區的JW對唱，隨即引來觀眾起哄。JW獻唱時，老公王至尊充當攝影師拍片，認真Sweet。當衛蘭唱出《大哥》時，見陳奕迅愛女陳康堤（包包）現身VIP區，雖然她早前跟黃澤林分手，惟心情似未受影響。</p><img alt=\"衛蘭《OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會》香港站紅館尾場，當晚擔任表演嘉賓的有JW。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/efa86cc791b6bbdf8d6b4a2c50303cc4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_22_25_06_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"站在360纜車上的衛蘭，同坐在VIP區的JW對唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/3719ea00622dc61304fb7453792414cc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_22_25_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"JW手舞足蹈，老公王至尊拍片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6f8c83b5773282981a1058519b74460a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_22_25_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"JW唱歌惹歡呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b1ac3e88cbec33576679680bf01e96bf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_22_25_07_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"JW和衛蘭合唱《男人信什麼》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b115e1007323b5121a87d965530704c8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_22_25_07_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"JW獻唱時，老公王至尊充當攝影師拍片，認真Sweet。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b960804514b2eddb2cabc875ba658df6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_22_25_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"（左起）康堤、Kiri T、Nancy。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/053d8fb5bebbc3ff2ebc019bf31b7784/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_22_25_08_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:04:08.357342+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:46:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:37:57.4934